    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the social services law, in relation to making vouchers\navailable under the family homelessness and eviction prevention supplement\nprogram in social services districts with a population of five million or more",
    "basePrintNo": "S6573",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6573-2021",
